# Git tracks code and the files that don't change while you play. Everything below is either
# recordings / screenshots, local setup, or rebuilt from your games over time.

# Pictures and videos (except the fixed ones listed further down)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv

# Local setup
.venv/
__pycache__/
obs_settings.json

# Everything captured / written while playing
Captures/
Latest Match Map.png
Latest Match Map Zoomed.png

# Your data: the workbook is written to after every match (back it up yourself), plus the old exports
*.ods
*.xlsx
*.csv
Manual.txt
Sorted/

# Screen detection crops: fixed (rebuilt by hand with Build_References.py)
!Screen_References/*.png
!Screen_References/legend_icons/*.png
!Screen_References/map_icons/*.png
!Screen_References/map_icons/far/*.png

# Maps: the original map picture and the POI list are fixed; the rest is rebuilt as you play
!Maps/*/reference_base.png
Maps/*/screens/
Maps/*/info.json
Maps/*/end_zones.json
*.npz
